<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea Shindaeyang sets 3-for-10 bonus.</title>
<headline>S.Korea Shindaeyang sets 3-for-10 bonus.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Shindaeyang Paper Co said in a statement on Wednesday it plans to offer a 3-for-10 bonus issue in March.</p>
<p>The company said it will issue 607,065 common shares for distribution to shareholders after the market closes on March 14. The face value of each share will be 5,000 won.</p>
<p>Shindaeyang's shares closed at 50,900 won each on Wednesday.</p>
<p>- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5644</p>
</text>
